   206                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   207                              <1> ; ps2_recv_hold: ps2_recv, then hold CLK low at once so that a following
   208                              <1> ; byte waits for us (the device aborts and retransmits it later). Same
   209                              <1> ; interface as ps2_recv; CLK is left inhibited.
   210                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
