    35                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    36                              <1> ; mouse_init: reset the mouse, set the sample rate, enable streaming.
    37                              <1> ; Leaves CLK inhibited (held low) and interrupts enabled.
    38                              <1> ;   out: CF=0 ok; CF=1, AL = stage that failed:
    39                              <1> ;        1 no reply to reset, 2 no self-test result, 3 rate rejected,
    40                              <1> ;        4 enable rejected
